{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01XNDYcGR6RTUG2wZUe7QPoq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Now let me check the package.json to see what versions of React and Next.js are installed, and then look at the external API fetches that would be good candidates for cacheSignal().\n\nFrom the search results, I can see:\n- `site/src/lib/beds24-client.ts` - fetches room availability (external API)\n- `site/src/app/actions/contact.ts` - sends contact form (could be wrapped in cache)\n- `site/src/app/actions/newsletter.ts` - sends newsletter signup (could be wrapped in cache)\n- `site/src/lib/meta-capi.ts` - Meta events\n\nThe beds24-client looks like it would be a good candidate for cacheSignal() since it's fetching room availability from an external API.\n\nLet me check the versions and understand the current implementation.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1020,"cache_read_input_tokens":71773,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1020},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"747c8b95-3597-4de2-850f-60587c80eb91","uuid":"1f8febe9-4df0-4156-9e3b-f1e3a7453a62"}
