{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019tuWYev6xEopCm9Uw8c3Hj","type":"tool_result","content":"1\timport Link from \"next/link\";\n2\timport Header from \"@/components/Header\";\n3\timport Footer from \"@/components/Footer\";\n4\timport BookingForm from \"@/components/BookingForm\";\n5\timport TrustSignals from \"@/components/TrustSignals\";\n6\timport BookEcommerceTracker from \"@/components/BookEcommerceTracker\";\n7\timport DuitNowPayment from \"@/components/DuitNowPayment\";\n8\timport FpxPaymentForm from \"@/components/FpxPaymentForm\";\n9\timport HeroTrustBadges from \"@/components/HeroTrustBadges\";\n10\timport ExitIntentOverlay from \"@/components/ExitIntentOverlay\";\n11\timport type { Metadata } from \"next\";\n12\texport const metadata: Metadata = {\n13\t  title: \"Book a Pod | Pelangi Capsule Hostel JB — From RM35/night\",\n14\t  description:\n15\t    \"Book your capsule pod at Pelangi Capsule Hostel in Johor Bahru. Direct WhatsApp booking from RM35/night or RM594/month. No platform fees, instant confirmation.\",\n16\t  keywords: [\n17\t    \"book capsule hostel JB\",\n18\t    \"Johor Bahru hostel booking\",\n19\t    \"budget accommodation JB\",\n20\t    \"Pelangi Capsule Hostel\",\n21\t    \"capsule pod JB\",\n22\t  ],\n23\t  alternates: {\n24\t    canonical: \"https://pelangicapsulehostel.com/book\",\n25\t  },\n26\t  openGraph: {\n27\t    title: \"Book a Pod | Pelangi Capsule Hostel JB\",\n28\t    description:\n29\t      \"Book direct from RM35/night. WhatsApp booking, no platform fees, instant confirmation at Pelangi Capsule Hostel Johor Bahru.\",\n30\t    url: \"https://pelangicapsulehostel.com/book\",\n31\t    siteName: \"Pelangi Capsule Hostel\",\n32\t    type: \"website\",\n33\t  },\n34\t};\n35\t\n36\tconst WHATSAPP_URL =\n37\t  \"https://wa.me/60127088789?text=Hi%20Pelangi%20Capsule%20Hostel!%20I'd%20like%20to%20book%20a%20pod.%20Please%20confirm%20availability%20for%20%5Bdates%5D.\";\n38\t\n39\tconst directBenefits = [\n40\t  {\n41\t    icon: \"M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\",\n42\t    title: \"No Platform Fees\",\n43\t    description: \"Save on OTA commissions — get the best rate guaranteed\",\n44\t  },\n45\t  {\n46\t    icon: \"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\",\n47\t    title: \"Instant Confirmation\",\n48\t    description: \"Get confirmed within minutes via WhatsApp reply\",\n49\t  },\n50\t  {\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"747c8b95-3597-4de2-850f-60587c80eb91","uuid":"7cc14529-b236-4d8b-ae40-6bbdbc96eee2","timestamp":"2026-04-14T01:54:36.616Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:/Users/Jyue/Documents/1-projects/Software Projects/pelangi-website/site/src/app/book/page.tsx","content":"import Link from \"next/link\";\nimport Header from \"@/components/Header\";\nimport Footer from \"@/components/Footer\";\nimport BookingForm from \"@/components/BookingForm\";\nimport TrustSignals from \"@/components/TrustSignals\";\nimport BookEcommerceTracker from \"@/components/BookEcommerceTracker\";\nimport DuitNowPayment from \"@/components/DuitNowPayment\";\nimport FpxPaymentForm from \"@/components/FpxPaymentForm\";\nimport HeroTrustBadges from \"@/components/HeroTrustBadges\";\nimport ExitIntentOverlay from \"@/components/ExitIntentOverlay\";\nimport type { Metadata } from \"next\";\nexport const metadata: Metadata = {\n  title: \"Book a Pod | Pelangi Capsule Hostel JB — From RM35/night\",\n  description:\n    \"Book your capsule pod at Pelangi Capsule Hostel in Johor Bahru. Direct WhatsApp booking from RM35/night or RM594/month. No platform fees, instant confirmation.\",\n  keywords: [\n    \"book capsule hostel JB\",\n    \"Johor Bahru hostel booking\",\n    \"budget accommodation JB\",\n    \"Pelangi Capsule Hostel\",\n    \"capsule pod JB\",\n  ],\n  alternates: {\n    canonical: \"https://pelangicapsulehostel.com/book\",\n  },\n  openGraph: {\n    title: \"Book a Pod | Pelangi Capsule Hostel JB\",\n    description:\n      \"Book direct from RM35/night. WhatsApp booking, no platform fees, instant confirmation at Pelangi Capsule Hostel Johor Bahru.\",\n    url: \"https://pelangicapsulehostel.com/book\",\n    siteName: \"Pelangi Capsule Hostel\",\n    type: \"website\",\n  },\n};\n\nconst WHATSAPP_URL =\n  \"https://wa.me/60127088789?text=Hi%20Pelangi%20Capsule%20Hostel!%20I'd%20like%20to%20book%20a%20pod.%20Please%20confirm%20availability%20for%20%5Bdates%5D.\";\n\nconst directBenefits = [\n  {\n    icon: \"M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\",\n    title: \"No Platform Fees\",\n    description: \"Save on OTA commissions — get the best rate guaranteed\",\n  },\n  {\n    icon: \"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\",\n    title: \"Instant Confirmation\",\n    description: \"Get confirmed within minutes via WhatsApp reply\",\n  },\n  {","numLines":50,"startLine":1,"totalLines":644}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01BqCFRmGJJWUeRLaqhAuYd2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /book page is mostly UI - it doesn't fetch availability data on the server side. The availability is likely fetched on the client side via the BookingForm component.\n\nLet me think about the best way to implement cacheSignal() for this story:\n\nSince cacheSignal() is designed for Server Components and requires using cache() from React, I need to:\n\n1. Create a new Server-side function that wraps the fetch with cache() and cacheSignal()\n2. This function should be in a file that can be imported by Server Components\n3. The function should wrap the beds24-client.getAvailability call\n\nActually, looking at the pattern more carefully, I should create a new file that exports a cached version of the getAvailability function. This will wrap the fetch call inside beds24Client.getAvailability with cache() and cacheSignal().\n\nHowever, there's a challenge: the getAvailability method is part of a class. To use cache() and cacheSignal(), I need to create a standalone function (not a method).\n\nHere's the best approach:\n\n1. Create a new file `site/src/lib/cached-availability.ts`\n2. In this file, import cache and cacheSignal from React\n3. Create a function that uses cache() to wrap an async function that fetches availability\n4. Inside the cache() wrapper, use cacheSignal() to pass the abort signal to fetch()\n\nLet me create this implementation:\n\n```typescript\nimport { cache } from 'react';\n\n// This signal fires when the cache entry's lifetime ends\nconst getCachedAvailability = cache(async (checkin: string, checkout: string) => {\n  const signal = cacheSignal();\n  \n  // Now use the signal to abort the fetch when cache is invalidated\n  const response = await fetch(/* ... */, { signal });\n  // ...\n});\n```\n\nWait, I need to check the cacheSignal() documentation more carefully. \n\nLooking at the React 19.2 docs, the pattern involves importing both cache and cacheSignal, then calling cacheSignal() inside the cached function to get an AbortSignal that terminates when the cache entry expires. I can then pass this signal to fetch() so requests are properly cleaned up when the cache lifetime ends.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1156,"cache_read_input_tokens":82174,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1156},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"747c8b95-3597-4de2-850f-60587c80eb91","uuid":"c0246a42-e938-470a-a4ca-1839ad591b0e"}
